/-! ## Supporting results

General-purpose results used in the proofs below: Fatou's lemma for `L^p` norms, Young's
inequality for convolutions, dual testing (Hölder, bounded and smooth tests), the envelope
`B_R(x) = R^{-n}(1 + |x|/R)^{-n-1}` with the bound `B_R * |f| ≤ C_n 𝖬 f` and `∫ B_R ≤ C_n`, and
`‖g‖₂² = ∫ |g|²`. They are items of Blueprint Lemmas 2.1, 2.2 and 2.4 of
`blueprints/discrete-sw.tex` (the Young and dual-testing assertions of Lemma 2.2 (`lem:young`)
live here), and are also used by the main development
(`DiscreteSW/Auto/DiscreteSteinWainger.lean`, section `Tools`). Their statements depend on
Mathlib and `DiscreteSW.Auto.HardyLittlewoodMaximal` (for `euclideanCube` and
